# Keep Vercel deployments small. Every retained deployment counts toward the
# team's Function Storage quota, and the local image archive alone is ~260 MB.
#
# The images stay in git (the gemini-review workflow and scripts use them) and
# in Supabase Storage. At runtime the UI loads every photo from Supabase
# Storage (resolvePhotoUrl in index.html), and the server's missing-image
# fallback returns a GitHub copy or an SVG placeholder, so nothing on Vercel
# needs these files.
images/review/
images/herbarium/
IMG_5763.jpg

# Test and dev-only files, never used by the running app.
tests/
playwright.config.js
review-preview.html
